# Review: 026f6f006c3ce0959207d1dd
# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/d0f4b78ca94d091eb97817d54dcc7131b983a05c/FreeCAD-Render/Render_sv-SE.ts
# Evidence-SHA256: a8548b3be70f280a5ed5636c3f95c20438a74da6f99938f6055790f8c91d544b
# Source-evidence: {}
